Description: Tools for the analysis of interval-censored data,
    including Turnbull-based survival estimation, bootstrap confidence
    intervals, group comparisons, imputation methods based on
    classical, parametric and machine-learning approaches, and
    landmark estimators of transition probabilities in progressive
    illness-death models with first gaps interval-censored.
